{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "ee2bcec4632564f55b4456086e546e2427d2ff718be172b495a930848479d1be", "ja": "Smileアイドルちゃん！", "zh": "Smile偶像女孩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7ece519080d8bdf90ad79d931c471088a4ce2baa65c9e198c82331c1366567a1", "ja": "イベント公演は大成功！　打ち上げにやって\nきた一同。亜利沙は律子、ひなた、美奈子か\nら努力を褒められつつ、今までのお返しとば\nかりにカメラを向けられてしまい、おおいに\n恥ずかしがるのだった。", "zh": "活动演出大获成功！大家一起来参加庆功宴。亚利沙受到律子、日向和美奈子的夸奖，称赞她一直以来的努力，却又被她们像要报答至今的恩情似的用相机对准，羞得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "542affbdecc532db5d7aa3f730e26d69e273c24c444505fa22e6cc2074389329", "ja": "（野外会場でのイベント公演は大成功！　今日は\nユニット全員で打ち上げにやってきた！）", "zh": "（户外会场的活动演出大获成功！今天组合全员一起来庆功了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "298456a99a84cfc620bb1a0ce3d26e1737ebdb7df8dcfd4f6998b3ba0ddec18a", "ja": "春の旬、いちごフェア……。\n真っ赤でおっきくて、よく育ったいちごだねぇ。", "zh": "春季时令，草莓节……\n又红又大，长得真好的草莓呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "c0786fb22919d5e59e7a8c83f40578b19696f058480ef5e95d7abab9438fb61d", "ja": "うん！　全部キラキラしてて、おいしそう♪\nうちの甘味も、季節を取り入れてみようかな……？", "zh": "嗯！全都闪闪发光的，看起来好好吃♪  \n我们家的甜点，要不要也试着融入季节特色呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "fcee646f14e31282f85daf95c07bb196a99c31162df27fb4521159eb390cb5b5", "ja": "さすがに魅力的ね……。まあ、\n今日くらいは遠慮なく食べてもいいわよね♪", "zh": "确实很诱人呢……不过，至少今天可以毫不客气地吃个痛快吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "5325ca8b3dcdc69bf1d58c41fa723ac1fdfe27e32b6bd9f4bac305c0608cbec2", "ja": "アイドルちゃん達とスイーツだなんて……\nこんな幸せ、いいんでしょうか……ムフ♪", "zh": "和偶像们一起吃甜点什么的……\n这样的幸福，真的可以吗……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b487de723e6d9b45883358502ee0520c77b50112cdb032c3b84d285c1965294d", "ja": "もちろん。今回、亜利沙は\n色々と頑張ってくれたからな。", "zh": "当然。这次亜利沙也帮了不少忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "3d123a4b7e2f268023765dfa8257d70a2c257a8a3f7628f3042c1d8b30778430", "ja": "そ、そんな！　ありさ、どっちかって言うと\nみんなに迷惑かけちゃいましたし……。", "zh": "没、没这回事！要说起来，反倒是我给大家添了不少麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "6b16b8c91b69b49998664f8cb37289b667f15d0d224a800165742e93cbecde2e", "ja": "むしろありさの方こそ、みんなにお詫びとして\nご馳走しなければならないのでは……！", "zh": "不如说亚利沙才应该请大家吃顿饭，\n当做赔罪才对吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "f118a3d33b2667f711ec9cb612c532c792ede5d3b2382fb196309b8e56fede27", "ja": "その認識は、私とは少し違うかしら。イベント公演は、\n亜利沙のおかげで盛り上がったと思ってるもの。", "zh": "我和你的看法，似乎有些不一样。正因为有了亜利沙，活动公演才能热闹起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "fc0287232c947494549c17ea9302fabf82419b08ef2e8e45850aba2c21215541", "ja": "うん！　亜利沙ちゃんの太鼓、\nすっごくわくわくするリズムだったよ！", "zh": "嗯！亚利沙的太鼓，\n节奏让人超级兴奋呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "053013751beb78e964966234b3bc75ed9c092d7f6f534596bf989d0888d43762", "ja": "お日様の光を浴びて、キラキラしてたべさ。", "zh": "沐浴在阳光下，闪闪发光的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "1d5336e6fc94b5cdb0ed4004ec14c58a1b75dc074d99ca49a9f0b0d5b3327474", "ja": "で、でも演奏は、みんなでがんばったからで！\nありさ、ほめられるようなコトは何も……。", "zh": "可、可是演出成功，是因为大家一起努力了呀！  \n人家、人家没做什么值得表扬的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "bec71046966020c8668e94c7b098719ae61bc0856347c53f3cf6f170c6bc1fa0", "ja": "確かに、公演が成功したのは、\nみんなが協力してがんばったからだと思うわ。", "zh": "确实，这次公演能够成功，\n我觉得是大家齐心协力共同努力的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "7f7b77304a56a0b8d777096ecc175e49dac88c0564bf86e8ff44ab1371690c66", "ja": "だからこそ、お詫びは違うんじゃないかしら？\nね、亜利沙。", "zh": "正因如此，道歉不是不太合适吗？\n对吧，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "9b8ed48de2f969ddd104148b780b2dae376265b345535b6c94b82bbd2fe8bbba", "ja": "律子さん……。", "zh": "律子小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "66b3274651556cf112b5fc6096aa0169dc0e46fd296b67e54eefdce2e0fd24b1", "ja": "あの……ありさ……みんなに、ありがとう、です！\n……えへへ♪", "zh": "那个……亚利沙……想对大家说声，谢谢你们！\n……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5eea487c51cb936b75af02bc2bcc76564e6a19b6e0bf0919142580bd4ff5c35c", "ja": "そういえば、今回のイベント公演の好評を受けて、\nDVD特典の時間が少し増やしてもらえるみたいだ。", "zh": "说起来，听说这次活动公演反响很好，DVD特典的时长似乎也能稍微增加一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "dfa1d2861a4e089eb2e7f2fb6f9b9077e32372ada7a9113163ef20f9c7511448", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？\nなら、新しい映像を追加で……！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？\n那就再追加一些新影像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "0323e50fcf48e299014c9705fea9955ef1a99a0f8cfa8dc97b9e474e0a3e16ad", "ja": "あら、それはどうかしら。\nだってまだ、私達に見せてない映像があるでしょ？", "zh": "哎呀，那可不一定吧。\n因为还有没给我们看的录像，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "4fdc2aa1ea210c1270b42cc5429b1bdf7fb035009ccae981483fa49b7303653b", "ja": "ギクッ！？\n律子さん……な、なぜそれを……！？", "zh": "咯噔！？\n律子姐……为、为什么你会知道……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "b4fd36e41a33a93b0b2e58faab899c2927611902ff99063e27380e3628a72a72", "ja": "亜利沙のお休み中に、ちょっとデジカメを\nチェックさせてもらったのよ。", "zh": "趁亚利沙休息的时候，我稍微检查了一下她的数码相机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "23b12387fe8abdd10ff9ee9901edb5130460140d53e1dd58f5a029b412bf5742", "ja": "私も見せてもらったけど……なんか、\nちょっとセクシーなやつとかあったよね……。", "zh": "我也看过，不过……好像有些照片，稍微有点性感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "28f679cf311269f4ad3b91d59cbbc043ecba6f74db67d9a5dfbefc6915084d45", "ja": "あたしも、鼻歌を歌ってるところを撮影され\nちゃって……あれ、本当にいつ撮ったのかねぇ。", "zh": "我也被拍到哼歌的样子了……真是的，到底是什么时候拍的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "83b8bdf53de0199b8b539233be1a91acfef146ef18341f60daa6d9f02fce9e5f", "ja": "いえっ、しかしですね！　せっかくですから、\nファンの方々の期待には応じなければと……！", "zh": "不对，不过既然难得有这个机会，就必须回应粉丝们的期待……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "374078a843b6efa61e3f8d58004d749da8e6af1c43ec5253e2dc0793ce17a481", "ja": "それはそうね。だから……今日の打ち上げでは、\n私達が亜利沙の写真や動画を撮らせてもらうわ！", "zh": "确实如此。所以……今天的庆功宴上，就让我们来给亚利沙拍些照片和视频吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "ddc56e1b2a02c837857dbb39841b3b587a95bfcace5e6f609d5b9a4113b901e8", "ja": "ええ～！？　ありさの！？\nそ、そんなの恥ずかしいですよ～！", "zh": "诶诶～！？拍亚利沙的！？\n这、这也太让人害羞了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "0cf062a21d87b2079767c0bd4ea03d260e65764889893f00458cb49679160474", "ja": "だって、亜利沙自身は全然写ってないんだもの。\nほらほら、ファンの期待には応えるんでしょう？", "zh": "因为照片里根本没拍到亚利沙本人嘛。\n好啦好啦，你不是要回应粉丝的期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "ff821fec273398f8d0cb8fd93b142e4627fc78fc525e9d4d2cb47ca418adca91", "ja": "いえっ、でも……あっ、撮影許可！\nお店で勝手に撮っちゃいけないんですよ！", "zh": "不，可是……啊，拍摄许可！\n在店里是不能擅自拍照的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "24331cd53dfc50d9d084924fa779791a8dd970b62827a4ce5d4b0bbc40c06261", "ja": "私がそんな詰めの甘い女だと思った？\nとっくに許可はもらってるわ。観念なさい。", "zh": "你以为我是那种考虑不周的人吗？\n早就拿到许可了。认命吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "d809d7bad5fef0839507d61047eaf97bddb5ad072514b131608c0b80fe826de6", "ja": "今までの分、たくさん撮ってあげねばねぇ。\n亜利沙さん、好きなケーキはどれだべか？", "zh": "到现在为止的份，要多拍一些才行呢。  \n亚利沙姐，喜欢哪种蛋糕呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "93219a2656d929d88e8150a0b6fa0b456adaca10a510fdc4e583bb8ccd4c2d7a", "ja": "いちごのミルフィーユ？　ミルクレープがいい？\n私が、あ～んしてあげるからね♪", "zh": "草莓千层酥？还是牛奶千层蛋糕？\n我来喂你吃哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_07_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "f9c9503a10daf0568a46a8565b3e92d732db243f975928f0470e2ea31103766d", "ja": "そ、そんな！　美奈子ちゃんからあ～んなんて、\nご褒美ですけど……ですけど！", "zh": "这、这怎么行！让美奈子喂我吃东西什么的，虽然是奖励……可、可是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
